                                                                                                         QUERY PLAN                                                                                                         
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Aggregate
   Output: asa_lane_div(asa_lane_mul('100'::double precision, as_sum(priv_hash(asa_hash(c_custkey), '-2141240251835189051'::bigint), c_custkey)), as_count(priv_hash(asa_hash(c_custkey), '-2141240251835189051'::bigint)))
   ->  Seq Scan on public.r_customer
